{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are now one of four crew members of a train as ancient as the universe itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which role would you like to play?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you see yourself as a Machinist who inspires his team to great achievements with his whip? Or are you a sturdily built Stoker wielding a heavy transformer shovel? Hmm, prefer to fight at a distance? In that case, take a look at the role of the Mechanic - this character is a master at wielding a revolver. Do you want to join the forbidden knowledge? Try on the role of the Guide: he will feed the passengers, heal the crew and turn into a chthonic creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In any case, whatever you choose, the main thing is not that at all. The most important thing is to work. A train must perform its functions forever, and it must always have a crew.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3748150?t=1750307574","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748150/81f50db4862206dd073e975b1ac0afb682cd0238/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750307574","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748150/3077e6592d7b87a82ec0027cc17752da2c56a8f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750307574","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748150/3077e6592d7b87a82ec0027cc17752da2c56a8f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750307574","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains unrealistic and cartoonish violence. Scenes of violence may also include blood, dismemberment, and killing as a result.\r\n\r\nSome storylines may contain descriptions of violence or incitement to it.\r\n\r\nThe game may also feature realistic depictions of tobacco smoking or alcohol consumption."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are now one of four crew members of a train as ancient as the universe itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which role would you like to play?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe you see yourself as a Machinist who inspires his team to great achievements with his whip? Or are you a sturdily built Stoker wielding a heavy transformer shovel? Hmm, prefer to fight at a distance? In that case, take a look at the role of the Mechanic - this character is a master at wielding a revolver. Do you want to join the forbidden knowledge? Try on the role of the Guide: he will feed the passengers, heal the crew and turn into a chthonic creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In any case, whatever you choose, the main thing is not that at all. The most important thing is to work. A train must perform its functions forever, and it must always have a crew.</p>","developers":["Take a Toad"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748150/faebed0e2958466bfe92ab86d4e691e1574d5c23/header.jpg?t=1750307574","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_